{"step_index":2810,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T12:56:01Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T15:56:01+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T15:56:01+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy/src/fast_match/coordinator.py`\nTotal Lines: 293\nTotal Bytes: 13814\nShowing lines 20 to 45\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n20:    - Note equivalencies: 1000mg = 1gm (1000مجم = 1جم), 500mg = 0.5gm, 0.25mg = ربع (250mcg).\n21: \n22: 2. DOSAGE FORM:\n23:    - If the requested drug specifies a dosage form (tablets vs syrup vs cream vs drops vs ampoules/injections) and the candidate is a DIFFERENT form (e.g. ampoule vs capsule, or syrup vs tablet):\n24:      YOU MUST RETURN \"status\": \"no_match\".\n25: \n26: 3. PACKAGING, PACK SIZE, TABLET COUNT & WHOLESALE UNITS (MATCH vs REVIEW):\n27:    - \"match\": Exact same active drug brand, same strength, same dosage form.\n28:      If pack size is identical OR not specified in the requested shortage (e.g. \"سيتال اقراص\" matching \"سيتال اقراص 20 قرص\", or \"كليكسان 40 حقن\" matching \"كليكسان 40مجم-84\"), return \"status\": \"match\".\n29:    - \"review\": Same active drug brand, same strength, same dosage form, BUT different pack size, tablet count, or packaging variant (e.g. requested 15 tablets vs candidate 60 tablets, requested 24 tablets vs candidate 48 tablets, requested medium vs candidate large / باكو 25).\n30:      In this case, return \"status\": \"review\" AND provide a clear Arabic explanation in \"reason\" (e.g. \"اختلاف عدد الأقراص: المطلوب 15 قرص والمرشح 60 قرص\" or \"اختلاف الحجم: المطلوب وسط والمرشح كبير باكو 25\").\n31: \n32: 4. WHOLESALE & PACKAGING METADATA:\n33:    - Terms like \"باكو 25\" (pack of 25), \"كرتونه 100\" (carton of 100), \"سعر جديد\", \"سعر قديم\", \"س ج\", \"-84\", \"-50\", \"32ب\", \"/المهن\", \"/العامرية\" indicate wholesale packaging, distributor codes, or prices.\n34:    - Take them into account to distinguish listings, but if candidate matches the drug, form, and strength, accept it or mark review if wholesale pack quantity differs from requested.\n35: \n36: SCHEMA:\n37: Return ONLY a valid JSON object matching this schema:\n38: {\n39:   \"results\": [\n40:     {\n41:       \"case_id\": \"string\",\n42:       \"status\": \"match\" | \"review\" | \"no_match\",\n43:       \"item_id\": \"string (candidate ID or empty string if no_match)\",\n44:       \"reason\": \"string (Arabic explanation when review, otherwise empty string)\"\n45:     }\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
